  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "34",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya hatachikiliyi kuyula wadiŋi wanyaka yitanu nayisatu. Wayulili muYerusalema nyaka makumi asatu namwaka wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welilaŋa chaŋa kumesu aYehova, wendelapa mwomwendelelaŋa nkakululayindi Davidi, hasenukilumu aya kuchikasa chachidiilu hela kuchimunswaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamwaka wawanta windi wamu chitanu nachisatu, iku wuchidi kansi, hakutachika kukeŋakeŋa Nzambi yankakulula yindi Davidi. Mumwakawekumi nakayedi, hakutachika kutookesha Yuda naYerusalema kutookeshakwakufumishamu yinaŋanaŋa, ninyiyombu, niakishi akubaza, niakishi akusuŋununa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuhumona tumeŋa twaBayali iku yena nemani; hakuketola niakishi etaŋwa adiŋi hewulu datumeŋa. Hakubalola ninyiyombu, niakishi akubaza, niakishi akusuŋununa, hakuyitwa yiikali niwuŋa, hakuwulalumwina hamajamu anawa ayiketwililaŋa yimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwocha mafwaha awatupristu hatumeŋa twawu, atookesha niYuda naYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wekumi nakatanu nakasatu wawanta windi, heliliyi natookeshi dehi niituŋa, niitala, hakutemesha mwana kaAzaliya Shafwani, ninguvuluya mukala Maseya, ni mwana kaYowahazi Yowa, mukwakusoneka nsaŋu, nindi, Kaloŋeshenu itala daYehova Nzambi yetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwinza kudi kapristu muneni Hilikiya, hiyakuhana mali aleteluwu mwitala daNzambi, atambwiluwu aLevi akwakuhemba kuchisu kudi akwaManase nawakwa-Efweremi, nikudi asheli muIsarela ejima, nikudi akwaYuda naBenjamini ejima, nikudi akwakushakama muYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyihana mumakasa awakwanyidimu atalilaŋa itala daYehova. Akwanyidimu akoŋelaŋa mwitala daYehova hiyakuyihana awahishaŋa nachu, alopeshaŋa nachu italahidafwafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyinka akwakusoŋa niakwakutuŋi, kulonda alandaŋa nachu malola akusoŋa dehi, ninyitondu yakunupaŋi nachu, niyakwilaŋa nachu nyalachi yakumatala akisapenuwu anyanta awaYuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenowu amayala akoŋeli mudimu wawu chakashinshi; akwakuyitala, wowu aLevi aYahati naObadiya akudi anyana kaMerari, niaZekariya naMeshulami akudi anyana kawaKohati, kulonda kutwalapa mudimu kumbidi, niaLevi amakwawu onsu, wowu eluka kwimba yuma yakwimbishaŋa nachu tumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diwu atalilaŋa niakwakusenda yiteli nawa, diwualejelaŋa antu ejima elilaŋa mudimu himudimu; kudi aLevi nawa kwadiŋi ansoneki, niatulala, niakwakuhemba kuyisu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chedishiluwu mali aleteluwu mwitala daYehova, kapristu Hilikiyahakuwana mukanda wanshimbi jaYehova jakukanwa kaMosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikiyaha kumwila nsoneki Shafwani, nindi, Nawani mukanda wanshimbi mwitala daYehova. Hilikiya hakumwinka Shafwani mukanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafwani hakutwala mukanda kudi mwanta, hakumuhitulwilamu mwanta nsaŋu, nindi, Yuma yejima yiwatu kunjikili etu ambuŋeyi adi nakwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anasukuli dehi mali anawanuwu mwitala daYehova, anayihani dehi kudi akwakutala nyidimu, nikudi akwanyidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsoneki Shafwani hakumuleja mwanta, nindi, Kapristu Hilikiya nanyinki mukanda. Shafwani hakutaŋamu kumesu amwanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta chatiyiliyi mazu anshimbi, hakutabola mahinindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakuleja Hilikiya, ni mwana kaShafwani Ahikami, ni mwana kaMika Abidoni, ninsoneki Shafwani, nikambuŋi mwanta Asaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yenu mwakaŋihwili kudi Yehova, mwakayihwili nianashali muIsarela namuYuda nsaŋu jamazu amumukanda wanawanuwu; muloŋa ndombu yaYehova yana twichiluwuyinatohi dehi, nanochu chabuliluwu ankakulula jetu kuhemba izu daYehova, chabuliluwu kwila mwejima mwanasonekuwu mumukanda iwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woho, Hilikiya nanawa alejeluwu kudi mwanta hiyakuya kudi kaprofwetu wamumbanda Hulida, iŋoda Shalumi, Shalumi mwana kaTokihati, Tokihati mwana kaHasira mukwakuhemba yuma yakuvwala. Henohuyenowu mumbanda wadiŋi washakama muYerusalema mushikola. Hiyakuhosha nindi mwenimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuyila nindi, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela nindi, Kamulejenu iyala wayitemesha kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenu, Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, hamukala iluŋa iwu nukuletelahu katama hamu nawakwakushaka mamu, wowu mashiŋu ejima anasonekuwu mumukanda wanataŋiluwu mwanta wawaYuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nanleki dehi, hiyakwochela akishi insensi, kulonda anvuloki nanyidimu yakumakasa awu nizuwi; dichindombu yami nayichili dehi hamukala iwu, hiyakamwenaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila mwanta wawaYuda, nayitemeshi nakwihwila kudi Yehova, kamwilenunenu, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela, wukweti mazu iwunatiyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yehova nindi, Ochu chiwatiya kumuchima lezu, hiwukudizoza ni kumesu aNzambi, chiwatiya mazu indi akuhoshola mukaliwu nawakwakushakamamu, chiwunadizozi dehi kumesu ami, hiwukutabula nimahineyi, hiwukudila kumesuami; ami nawa nakutiyi dehi; dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
